#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:7
msgid "git-remote-fd - Reflect smart transport stream back to caller"
msgstr ""
"git-remote-fd - スマートトランスポートストリームを呼び出し元に反映します"
"(Reflect smart transport stream back to caller)"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:11
msgid "\"fd::<infd>[,<outfd>][/<anything>]\" (as URL)"
msgstr "\"fd::<infd>[,<outfd>][/<anything>]\" (as URL)"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:17
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This helper uses specified file descriptors to connect to a remote Git "
#| "server.  This is not meant for end users but for programs and scripts "
#| "calling git fetch, push or archive."
msgid ""
"This helper uses specified file descriptors to connect to a remote Git "
"server.  This is not meant for end users but for programs and scripts "
"calling git fetch, push, or archive."
msgstr ""
"このヘルパーは、指定のファイルデスクリプタを使用してリモートGitサーバーに接続"
"します。これはエンドユーザー向けではなく、git fetch、pushまたはarchiveを呼び"
"出すプログラムとスクリプトを対象としています。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:23
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If only <infd> is given, it is assumed to be a bidirectional socket "
#| "connected to remote Git server (git-upload-pack, git-receive-pack or git-"
#| "upload-archive). If both <infd> and <outfd> are given, they are assumed "
#| "to be pipes connected to a remote Git server (<infd> being the inbound "
#| "pipe and <outfd> being the outbound pipe."
msgid ""
"If only <infd> is given, it is assumed to be a bidirectional socket "
"connected to a remote Git server (git-upload-pack, git-receive-pack, or git-"
"upload-archive). If both <infd> and <outfd> are given, they are assumed to "
"be pipes connected to a remote Git server (<infd> being the inbound pipe and "
"<outfd> being the outbound pipe)."
msgstr ""
"<infd> のみが指定されている場合は、リモートGitサーバー(git-upload-pack、git-"
"receive-pack または git-upload-archive)に接続されている双方向ソケットであると"
"見なされます。 <infd> と <outfd> の両方が指定されている場合、それらはリモート"
"Gitサーバーに接続されているパイプであると見なされます( <infd> は入力パイプ、 "
"<outfd> は出力パイプです)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:26
msgid ""
"It is assumed that any handshaking procedures have already been completed "
"(such as sending service request for git://) before this helper is started."
msgstr ""
"このヘルパーが開始される前に、ハンドシェイク手順(git:// のサービスリクエスト"
"の送信など)がすでに完了していることを前提としています。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:30
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<anything> can be any string. It is ignored. It is meant for providing "
#| "information to user in the URL in case that URL is displayed in some "
#| "context."
msgid ""
"<anything> can be any string. It is ignored. It is meant for providing "
"information to the user in the URL in case that URL is displayed in some "
"context."
msgstr ""
"<anything> は任意の文字列にすることができます。それは無視されます。これは、"
"URLが何らかのコンテキストで表示される場合に、URLでユーザーに情報を提供するた"
"めのものです。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"
msgstr "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "GIT_TRANSLOOP_DEBUG"
msgstr "GIT_TRANSLOOP_DEBUG"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:35
msgid "If set, prints debugging information about various reads/writes."
msgstr ""
"設定されている場合、さまざまな 読み取り/書き込み に関するデバッグ情報を出力し"
"ます。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "EXAMPLES"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git fetch fd::17 master`"
msgstr "`git fetch fd::17 master`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:41
msgid ""
"Fetch master, using file descriptor #17 to communicate with git-upload-pack."
msgstr ""
"ファイルデスクリプタ #17 使用して master を Fetch し、 git-upload-pack と通信"
"します。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git fetch fd::17/foo master`"
msgstr "`git fetch fd::17/foo master`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:44
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:52
msgid "Same as above."
msgstr "同上。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git push fd::7,8 master (as URL)`"
msgstr "`git push fd::7,8 master (as URL)`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:49
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Push master, using file descriptor #7 to read data from git-receive-pack "
#| "and file descriptor #8 to write data to same service."
msgid ""
"Push master, using file descriptor #7 to read data from git-receive-pack and "
"file descriptor #8 to write data to the same service."
msgstr ""
"master を push し、ファイルデスクリプタ #7 を使用して git-receive-pack から"
"データを読み取り、ファイルデスクリプタ #8 を使用して同じサービスにデータを書"
"き込みます。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-remote-fd.txt:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git push fd::7,8/bar master`"
msgstr "`git push fd::7,8/bar master`"

